8	 * total (the sum of every SENT invoice amount — money actually owed). An invoice counts only once
9	 * it has been sent: DRAFTs have not gone out yet and PAID invoices are already settled, so both are
10	 * excluded. A cross-entity aggregate read, so it injects all three repositories. Wired by
